        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "If \\(\\vec a\\) and \\(\\vec b\\) are non-zero vectors such that \\(\\lvert\\vec a+\\vec b\\rvert=\\lvert\\vec a-\\vec b\\rvert\\), then the angle between them is",
