        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "Let \\(\\vec a=2\\hat i-\\hat j+2\\hat k\\) and \\(\\vec b=\\hat i+2\\hat j-2\\hat k\\). Find \\(\\lvert2\\vec a-\\vec b\\rvert\\).",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "\\(2\\vec a-\\vec b=2(2\\hat i-\\hat j+2\\hat k)-(\\hat i+2\\hat j-2\\hat k)=3\\hat i-4\\hat j+6\\hat k\\). Thus \\(\\lvert2\\vec a-\\vec b\\rvert=\\sqrt{3^2+(-4)^2+6^2}=\\sqrt{61}\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
        "time_limit_seconds": 30,
        "points": 10,
        "sort_order": 108,
