        "question_title": "If \\(\\lvert\\vec a\\rvert=3\\), \\(\\lvert\\vec b\\rvert=4\\), and the angle between \\(\\vec a\\) and \\(\\vec b\\) is \\(60^\\circ\\), then \\(\\lvert2\\vec a-\\vec b\\rvert\\) equals",
